  {
    "__type__": "cc.RichText",
    "_name": "",
    "_objFlags": 0,
    "node": {
      "__id__": 69
    },
    "_enabled": true,
    "_fontFamily": "Arial",
    "_isSystemFontUsed": true,
    "_N$string": "\n<color=#cccccc><size=29><b>\n1. I. Invite your friends to download the <color=#fbbd4d>game. xox.com</color>, film your invitation code: <color=#fbbd4d>x@ox</color> when registering, and he will join your club\n2. If your friend has not bound an invitation code, you can manually bind his game ID to your club through the invitation function\n3. Your friend transfers money to you, you recharge his coins, and when he needs to withdraw money, you deduct his coins and then transfer the money to your friend. All the income he generates belongs to you\n4. If you don't have enough available coins, please contact customer service to purchase coins.\n</b></size></color>",
    "_N$horizontalAlign": 0,
    "_N$fontSize": 40,
    "_N$font": null,
    "_N$cacheMode": 0,
    "_N$maxWidth": 1600,
    "_N$lineHeight": 45,
